#: chromaleon.js:142
msgid "User Themes incompatibility warning."
msgstr "Avertiment per l'incompatibilitat de User Themes."

#: chromaleon.js:144
msgid ""
"ChromaLeon is incompatible with the User Themes extension. Keep the User "
"Themes extension disabled to avoid visual conflicts and unexpected behavior."
msgstr ""
"ChromaLeon es incompatible amb l'extension User Themes. Daissatz l'extension "
"User Themes desactivada per evitar conflictes visuals e compòrtaments "
"inesperats."

#: chromaleon.js:148
msgid "I understood"
msgstr "Plan comprés"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:38
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferéncias"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:77
msgid "ChromaLeon only exists thanks to users like you!"
msgstr "ChromaLeon existís pas que gràcia als utilizaires coma vos !"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:79
msgid ""
"If ChromaLeon has earned a place in your device's customization, consider "
"helping the project move forward by making a small donation."
msgstr ""
"Se ChromaLeon a ganhat una plaça dins la personalizacion de vòstre aparelh, "
"consideratz d'ajudar lo projècte a progressar en fasent un pichon don."

