#: ui/preferencesPage.js:353
msgid "Applies integration with the MoreWaita icon pack."
msgstr "Aplica l'integracion amb lo paquet d'icònas MoreWaita."

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:390
msgid "Customization"
msgstr "Personalizacion"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:395
msgid "Custom stylesheet"
msgstr "Fuèlh d’estil personalizat"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:397
msgid ""
"A file that overrides the CSS of the shell and user extensions, with support "
"for ChromaLeon accent colors."
msgstr ""
"Un fichièr que subrecarga lo CSS del Shell e de las extensions d'utilizaire, "
"amb lo supòrt de las colors d'accent ChromaLeon."

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:416 ui/preferencesPage.js:433
#: ui/preferencesPage.js:493
msgid "About the custom stylesheet"
msgstr "A prepaus del fuèlh d'estil personalizat"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:422
msgid "Open file"
msgstr "Dobrir fichièr"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:435
msgid ""
"This file is used to apply custom CSS to GNOME Shell.\n"
"\n"
"The extension processes all content within this file, replacing the "
"<b><tt>@@ACCENT@@</tt></b> and <b><tt>-st-accent-color</tt></b> variables "
"with the color selected in the ChromaLeon settings before applying them to "
"the system. This can be useful if an extension does not have the accent "
"colors applied correctly.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tip:</b> If your changes do not take effect, try adding <b><tt>!"
"important</tt></b> to your CSS rules."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste fichièr es utilizat per aplicar de CSS personalizat a GNOME Shell.\n"
"\n"
"L'extension tracta tot lo contengut d'aqueste fichièr, en remplaçant las "
"variablas <b><tt>@@ACCENT@@</tt></b> e <b><tt>-st-accent-color</tt></b> per "
"la color seleccionada dins los paramètres de ChromaLeon abans de las aplicar "
"al sistèma. Aquò pòt èsser util se una extension aplica pas corrèctament las "
"colors d'accentuacion.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Astúcia :</b> Se vòstres cambiaments fan pas d'efièch, ensajatz d'apostar "
"<b><tt>!important</tt></b> a vòstras règlas CSS."

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:442 ui/preferencesPage.js:511
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tampar"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:464
msgid "Failed to open custom.css: "
msgstr "Fracàs de la dobertura de custom.css: "

